OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FToday, a fresh breeze will
OL,6,Fbring scattered showers, particularly
OL,7,Fin the west. Feeling warm with
OL,8,Foccasional breaks to sunshine
OL,9,Fthroughout the day, but a touch cooler
OL,10,Falong exposed North Devon coasts where
OL,11,Fwinds will be strong.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FSome light showers will
OL,14,Fcontinue in the west through the
OL,15,Fnight, and with winds easing it will
OL,16,Ffeel chilly in single-digit
OL,17,Ftemperatures.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
