OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FA bright and chilly morning,
OL,6,Fthough mostly cloudy. The cloud will
OL,7,Fthicken ahead of a band of patchy rain
OL,8,Fand strengthening winds which arrive
OL,9,Fduring the afternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FMonday
OL,12,Fwill be widely overcast with spots of
OL,13,Fdrizzle through the day. Becoming much
OL,14,Fbrighter on Tuesday after a morning of
OL,15,Frain and strong winds. Bright and
OL,16,Fbreezy on Wednesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
